Subject: [PATCH 20/37] Cloud patch 0007-one-request-one-frame, ported with one
 design call: a redraw is matched only on its own surface

Head routes charts to surfaces (the plan tab); a same-titled chart on another tab is a new frame
there, not a correction. The client swap is unchanged: every chart still appends to one doc array
with one row, so the replaced index keeps its surface. New full-turn test (fails without the
surface filter); redraw 3/3, canvasDoc 12/12. Revert this commit to drop 0007.
